WEBVTT

00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:14,720
is a rife machine the best way to kill cancer? I can't remember if I had this on last week or not.

00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:21,600
I would say the rife machine doesn't kill cancer. Again, you have to be careful about any claims

00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:28,320
that you're making. I think a rife machine properly programmed, properly working with the right

00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:34,880
frequencies for that person that has cancer can help your immune system kill cancer. But I don't think

00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:42,560
the rife machine directly destroys cancer or kills cancer. Even though I think anybody with cancer

00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:48,960
should be using the rife machine, I don't think I'd be talking to you right now. I didn't

00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:56,000
use the rife machine for my cancer. And I will stand by that, tell my death. I really think that's

00:00:56,640 --> 00:01:04,320
besides the grace of God. I think God led me to be able to program rife for me and to get the benefits

00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:11,680
from it. But I also say that it doesn't, it's not a magic wand. And it works at conjunction with

00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:17,920
the person's immune system and other things that you're doing. So all those things together are the

00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:23,200
best way to help deal with cancer. You've got to take a big picture view of everybody.

00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:27,600
Because again, everybody is unique. So

